          "author": "Quadricorn Media, Gen-Z Media",
          "description": "Meet Ruby, a tough-as-enamel Detective at the Tooth Fairy Bureau of Investigation (TFBI), and Wren, a nervous tech fairy, who are forced to team up for the ultimate case. Their mission? Find the stolen Wishing Tooth - an ancient relic with the power to reshape reality. To catch the thief, Ruby and Wren must uncover a trail of clues that force them to face their deepest fears. From the streets of New York City to the lost tomb of Queen Nefertiti, this high-flying adventure is packed with magic, gadgets, and danger. Can they rely on each other and save the world before a wish is made?\n\nOne wish could change everything...\nThis podcast contains ads. Yoto does not control these ads and they do not represent us or our opinions. Please listen with care.\n    ",
